  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0006_50749186eab0.png\" style=\"width:2.69375in;height:1.84028in\" /><br />Solving <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> &amp; <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>;</mo></math> we get <math><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Thus, the required area<br /><math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8756;</